I look for a nearby clinic on my phone.
I find a clinic.
I call their reception.
A woman answers the phone.
"Hello, I need to see a doctor," I say.
"Okay, what is the problem?" she asks.
"I have a fever and a headache."
"My throat hurts a lot too."
"Okay, what is your name?" she asks.
"My name is Maya."
"Are you coming here for the first time?" she asks.
"Yes," I say.
"Please tell me your phone number."
I say my mobile number.
"Ninety eight, seventy six, fifty four, thirty two, ten."
"Okay, you must come at ten thirty this morning," she says.
"I will come," I say.
I hang up the phone and get ready to go.
